  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Amity University Dubai, part of the prestigious Amity Education Group, is a leading private university located in the heart of Dubai International Academic City. Established in 2008, Amity University Dubai offers a wide range of undergraduate and postgraduate programmes across various disciplines.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Amity University Dubai, you’ll have a multicultural student community. The university's Students' Council organises regular events and activities to keep you engaged, from cultural festivals to workshops and seminars. You’ll also find a range of clubs and societies here.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Although Amity University Dubai doesn’t have on-campus housing, the university helps you look for safe and affordable accommodation nearby.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>You’ll find a modern and spacious library equipped with a wide range of digital and physical resources, including books, journals, and e-resources.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>The campus features state-of-the-art sports facilities, including a gym, basketball courts, and fitness centres.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>Amity offers specialised labs for various disciplines, including engineering, computer science, media studies, and health sciences.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>You can dine at multiple cafes across the campus, including the university cafe and other facilities, such as Tim Hortons.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
